PUSH
ORG $846AC
POIN BattleQuoteTable
POP

#define SpecifiedBattleConvo(Character1,Character2,Chapter,EventID,TextID) "SHORT Character1 Character2 Chapter EventID TextID 0x0 0x0 0x0; SHORT Character2 Character1 Chapter EventID TextID 0x0 0x0 0x0"
#define UnspecifiedBattleConvo(Character,Chapter,EventID,TextID) "SHORT Character 0x0 Chapter EventID TextID 0x0 0x0 0x0; SHORT 0x0 Character Chapter EventID TextID 0x0 0x0 0x0"
#define UnspecifiedAttackerConvo(Character,Chapter,EventID,TextID) "SHORT Character 0x0 Chapter EventID TextID 0x0 0x0 0x0"
#define UnspecifiedAttackedConvo(Character,Chapter,EventID,TextID) "SHORT 0x0 Character Chapter EventID TextID 0x0 0x0 0x0"

ALIGN 4
BattleQuoteTable:
//Prologue
SpecifiedBattleConvo(0x14,EmiliaBoss,Prologue,Flag13,BotanPrologueQuote)
SpecifiedBattleConvo(0x11,EmiliaBoss,Prologue,Flag14,RisuPrologueQuote)
SpecifiedBattleConvo(0x10,EmiliaBoss,Prologue,Flag15,RobocoPrologueQuote)
SpecifiedBattleConvo(Amelia,EmiliaBoss,Prologue,BossQuote,AmeliaMonsterQuote)
//Chapter1
UnspecifiedBattleConvo(0x46,0x1,BossQuote,NoirBattleQuote)

BYTE 0xFF 0xFF 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0 0x0  // Terminator